WEBVTT

00:04.880 --> 00:09.210
I ended up with plans to meet Yamada
and borrow the next volume of that manga.

00:09.500 --> 00:13.540
<b>Anna Yamada</b>

00:09.500 --> 00:13.540
<b>Dec 24 (Tues)</b>

00:09.500 --> 00:13.540
<b>Tomorrow</b>

00:09.500 --> 00:13.540
<b>By Hachiko in Shibuya</b>

00:09.500 --> 00:13.540
<b>How's 2PM sound?</b>

00:09.510 --> 00:13.540
<b>It's today already.</b>

00:09.830 --> 00:12.170
Why in Shibuya, though?

00:12.380 --> 00:14.000
We could have just met at our local station...

00:14.460 --> 00:15.710
<b>Dec 24 (Tues)</b>

00:14.670 --> 00:15.710
And...

00:15.880 --> 00:18.460
Why did I get here so early?

00:18.460 --> 00:21.630
I-it's not like I was excited, or anything...

00:21.630 --> 00:24.290
Just wanted to make sure I found the place.

00:30.170 --> 00:32.630
W-we're supposed to meet at two, right...?

00:34.670 --> 00:38.210
Is that really her...?

00:45.670 --> 00:46.880
Yup, definitely is.

00:53.920 --> 00:55.500
You spooked me!

00:55.500 --> 00:58.290
Oh, w-weren't we meeting up at two?

00:58.290 --> 01:02.380
Oh, uhh, I just wanted to make sure I found the place...

01:08.670 --> 01:10.290
So, the manga-

01:10.290 --> 01:11.170
Hey!

01:11.670 --> 01:13.580
There's this place I want to check out.

01:13.580 --> 01:14.210
Want to come?

01:14.210 --> 01:16.580
Hmm. I mean, I guess so.

01:16.580 --> 01:17.630
Yay!

01:17.630 --> 01:19.420
Wow, she smells so nice...

01:19.790 --> 01:21.540
Big crowd, huh...

01:21.830 --> 01:23.750
Maybe because it's almost New Years?

01:23.750 --> 01:24.500
Let's go.

01:24.500 --> 01:28.830
Uhh, more like 'cause it's Christmas Eve!

03:04.790 --> 03:09.170
Yamada doesn't seem to have any idea what day it is.

03:09.460 --> 03:12.380
She's probably just here running some other errands.

03:12.790 --> 03:16.330
Better try and not walk side by side, huh...

03:20.290 --> 03:22.210
I look like a straight up stalker!

03:23.000 --> 03:25.330
That'd explain the look.

03:27.830 --> 03:28.830
Oh!

03:29.710 --> 03:31.210
You finally showed your face.

03:38.130 --> 03:40.210
Fine, here.

03:40.210 --> 03:42.380
Oh, sorry... I'll carry it-

03:41.330 --> 03:44.540
<b>Kimi Iro Octave</b>

03:42.380 --> 03:43.210
No!

03:48.210 --> 03:49.670
Now we won't get split up.

03:57.040 --> 03:59.380
You're gonna get in people's way. Stick close!

03:59.380 --> 04:00.790
What am I, a dog?

04:01.420 --> 04:02.960
Pancakes?

04:03.460 --> 04:05.710
They look so nice,
and I hear they taste great!

04:06.080 --> 04:07.460
They're open for brunch!

04:08.960 --> 04:10.210
S-should we not?

04:10.920 --> 04:13.170
N-no, we can...

04:14.130 --> 04:15.040
This is bad...

04:15.330 --> 04:18.000
This is starting to feel like a date...

04:18.000 --> 04:18.880
Let's go!
This is starting to feel like a date...<b></b>

04:18.880 --> 04:19.830
This is starting to feel like a date...

04:23.130 --> 04:27.000
Did you know you shouldn't go to
an amusement park on a first date?

04:28.330 --> 04:29.380
Why not?

04:29.580 --> 04:34.460
Apparently waiting in line gets
awkward and the relationship falls apart.

04:34.460 --> 04:37.380
But, that doesn't seem true!

04:41.130 --> 04:42.250
What do you mean?

04:45.920 --> 04:47.040
What now?

04:47.330 --> 04:49.460
What's bothering her?

04:50.830 --> 04:52.170
Now that I think about it,

04:52.170 --> 04:56.630
I heard it's better if the guy stands
in front on stairs and escalators.

04:56.830 --> 04:57.580
I-

04:58.290 --> 04:59.830
I'll go in front...

05:00.580 --> 05:02.630
N-no, no, no!

05:02.630 --> 05:03.630
Why?

05:05.330 --> 05:07.420
And so then-

05:17.170 --> 05:18.960
What is it?

05:18.960 --> 05:22.790
I was just trying to figure out how you did your hair...

05:24.000 --> 05:28.380
My mom did it for me. I can't really do this myself.

05:28.380 --> 05:29.710
Really?

05:29.960 --> 05:30.960
Yeah, why?

05:30.960 --> 05:31.750
Nothing...

05:32.130 --> 05:37.000
I just thought she seemed pretty strict when
I saw her at our parent-teacher conferences.

05:37.290 --> 05:39.080
She is when we're out.

05:39.290 --> 05:43.830
But she's super nice at home.
Calls me Anna-chan and everything.

05:44.080 --> 05:45.380
That's pretty cute.

05:48.830 --> 05:50.170
Ichikawa...

05:51.710 --> 05:53.460
Never heard you say "cute" before.

05:55.750 --> 05:58.330
D-did I just creep her out?

06:09.670 --> 06:11.670
Wow, I don't know what to pick!

06:11.670 --> 06:14.080
Thank goodness she cheers up at like mach 10 speed.

06:17.420 --> 06:19.710
<b>Pancakes</b>

06:17.420 --> 06:19.710
<b>Berry Deluxe Pancake</b>

06:17.630 --> 06:18.540
This stuff's expensive!

06:18.540 --> 06:19.670
What are you getting?

06:21.420 --> 06:23.130
J-just coffee...

06:23.130 --> 06:24.880
Really, that's all?

06:24.880 --> 06:27.500
Not big on sweet stuff...

06:28.290 --> 06:31.750
Sorry, I should have picked a regular cafe, then.

06:31.750 --> 06:33.750
N-no big deal...

06:33.920 --> 06:36.250
Damn it all!

06:36.250 --> 06:37.880
Are you ready to order?

06:38.750 --> 06:43.460
We'll have the berry deluxe pancake set with milk tea.

06:43.460 --> 06:45.380
Uh... and a coffee.

06:45.380 --> 06:48.080
Would you like hot or iced coffee?

06:48.710 --> 06:49.630
What do you want?

06:49.630 --> 06:50.500
Hot...

06:50.500 --> 06:51.580
Hot, please.

06:51.750 --> 06:54.250
And would you like our house blend or cafe Americano?

06:54.540 --> 06:55.380
Which?

06:55.750 --> 06:56.670
The blend...

06:56.670 --> 06:58.000
We'll take the blend.

06:58.000 --> 06:59.500
Very good.

07:02.500 --> 07:03.790
Just kill me now...

07:05.460 --> 07:06.500
Ichikawa.

07:06.500 --> 07:07.250
Huh?

07:07.250 --> 07:09.080
You really like black, huh?

07:09.080 --> 07:09.790
Oh...

07:09.960 --> 07:12.630
Oh, my clothes, yeah...

07:12.630 --> 07:14.630
I don't own anything not black...

07:14.830 --> 07:16.130
I like it, too!

07:16.130 --> 07:20.670
I mean, I'm not wearing any today,
but a lot of my clothes are black.

07:21.000 --> 07:25.040
I bet it looks a lot different on you than me, though...

07:26.170 --> 07:27.580
Meaning...?

07:27.750 --> 07:33.210
When someone with fashion sense wears it,
it's always stylish and cool.

07:33.750 --> 07:37.330
But for me, it's just the only color I don't avoid.

07:42.170 --> 07:46.500
Wha?! Did I just start mansplaining
fashion to a literal pro model?!

07:46.500 --> 07:49.250
You know, my stylist said the same thing.

07:49.250 --> 07:51.290
Look at her struggle to follow that...
The same color looks totally different<b></b>

07:51.290 --> 07:52.250
depending on the person and their outfit.

07:52.250 --> 07:53.250
This is bad...
depending on the person and their outfit.<b></b>

07:53.290 --> 07:54.250
<b>Looking like a stalker</b>

07:54.040 --> 07:57.830
I'm really racking up the mess-up points quick today.

07:54.290 --> 07:55.250
<b>Called her mom cute</b>

07:55.290 --> 07:56.250
<b>Lied about hating sweet stuff</b>

07:56.290 --> 07:57.250
<b>Made Yamada order</b>

07:57.290 --> 07:58.830
<b>Mansplained fashion</b>

07:58.130 --> 07:59.920
Sorry for the wait.

07:59.920 --> 08:01.420
Here's our house blend.

08:04.130 --> 08:05.960
I said I hate sweet stuff...

08:08.080 --> 08:09.130
Wow.

08:09.630 --> 08:11.670
It's like a bitter soup...

08:13.750 --> 08:18.000
I really shouldn't have come out here with her...

08:18.000 --> 08:21.580
We get along fine at school and all so I figured...

08:21.580 --> 08:27.880
But out here, it's so much more obvious
what different lives we lead...

08:30.080 --> 08:34.830
Sorry to keep you waiting!
Here's your Berry Deluxe Pancake set.

08:35.920 --> 08:39.500
Wow, look at this!

08:45.250 --> 08:47.130
Oh, right.

08:47.460 --> 08:49.500
Hey, take a picture for me!

08:49.500 --> 08:51.080
Oh, okay...

08:51.710 --> 08:54.000
Right. For the socials. Of course.

08:54.000 --> 08:55.250
Of me eating it!
Right. For the socials. Of course.<b></b>

08:55.420 --> 08:56.960
That's what this place is for.

08:58.290 --> 09:02.420
She's going to share that face with the whole world.

09:02.420 --> 09:06.250
But I mean, isn't that a little huge?
How's that gonna do on the socials?

09:08.540 --> 09:09.210
Seriously?!

09:10.380 --> 09:13.170
I almost forgot, she's still Yamada.

09:14.630 --> 09:16.880
This would probably be better as a video.

09:17.130 --> 09:18.460
Oh! Goob ibea!

09:19.000 --> 09:20.540
Aaand, rolling.

09:24.830 --> 09:26.130
Okay, cut.

09:26.130 --> 09:27.460
Okay, Mifter Direftor.

09:29.750 --> 09:30.710
Wow.

09:32.130 --> 09:35.670
I don't mind taking this,
but are you sure you wanna upload it?

09:36.000 --> 09:37.380
Won't it look bad?

09:38.130 --> 09:40.250
What? I'm not uploading this.

09:47.000 --> 09:48.790
I'm sending them all to you.

10:08.130 --> 10:11.130
Don't forget to watch the real thing...

10:27.670 --> 10:29.540
What do you think?

10:30.080 --> 10:31.420
Looks fine to me.

10:35.420 --> 10:38.920
Somehow I wound up tagging
along on her bubbly shopping trip.

10:39.080 --> 10:40.750
Oh, I'll pay.

10:40.750 --> 10:41.540
But...

10:41.540 --> 10:43.330
I get paid for work and stuff.

10:43.330 --> 10:44.790
<b>Made Yamada Pay</b>

10:45.000 --> 10:47.920
I really messed up back there at the cafe...

10:47.920 --> 10:50.420
Sorry about this. Must feel awkward.

10:50.420 --> 10:52.880
Nah, I come with my sister sometimes.

10:53.040 --> 10:55.500
Yeah? You two are close, huh?

10:56.710 --> 10:59.330
Hey, which do you think is cuter?

10:59.630 --> 11:00.540
Beats me.

11:00.540 --> 11:03.500
Just buy whatever you like best.

11:03.500 --> 11:04.580
No, come on!

11:05.580 --> 11:09.000
Which do YOU think is cuter?

11:09.000 --> 11:12.000
Huh? W-well, then this one.

11:13.830 --> 11:15.250
This one is...?

11:15.500 --> 11:16.920
...c-cuter...

11:16.920 --> 11:18.330
The color gives it a more relaxed look.

11:21.790 --> 11:25.170
This is like a scene out of some rom-com.

11:28.380 --> 11:30.580
On the other side of this curtain...

11:31.080 --> 11:32.460
Yamada is...

11:37.630 --> 11:38.750
Ta-da!

11:40.540 --> 11:41.790
Hey!

11:44.420 --> 11:46.420
I don't need to stand right in front, right?

11:46.420 --> 11:47.420
Yes you do!

11:47.420 --> 11:49.960
I've got something else to try on, so wait there.

11:56.210 --> 11:57.420
Don't think about it.

11:57.420 --> 11:59.790
Get a boner and you're trash...
Get a boner and you're trash... Get a boner...

11:59.790 --> 12:01.790
I've been wanting a new skirt.

12:01.790 --> 12:02.460
Sounds good.

12:02.460 --> 12:03.210
Yeah.

12:03.960 --> 12:05.250
Everything here's so cute, right?

12:05.250 --> 12:05.710
Yeah!
Everything here's so cute, right?<b></b>

12:05.750 --> 12:06.580
My sis-

12:06.580 --> 12:08.170
Voila!

12:08.880 --> 12:09.960
Shh!

12:11.330 --> 12:12.830
Oh, uhh, it's my sister...

12:13.040 --> 12:13.750
Your sister...?

12:15.830 --> 12:17.670
I-I should say hi-

12:20.080 --> 12:21.380
Not now...

12:24.130 --> 12:25.830
Can I try this on?

12:26.290 --> 12:28.250
You can use any open stall.

12:50.130 --> 12:51.750
Sorry about this...

12:51.750 --> 12:52.790
It's fine...

12:54.540 --> 12:55.420
What's wrong?

12:56.830 --> 12:58.250
Nothing...

13:00.790 --> 13:01.710
Hey...

13:02.880 --> 13:04.210
About what you said...

13:04.750 --> 13:06.170
"Not now..."

13:06.920 --> 13:08.210
Why not?

13:10.750 --> 13:12.330
When can I?

13:14.500 --> 13:17.500
S-some other time...

13:19.960 --> 13:21.290
That's a promise, then.

13:24.330 --> 13:26.960
I ended up sweating through
something I was only trying on.

13:26.960 --> 13:28.750
Wait, you aren't gonna buy it?

13:29.210 --> 13:30.330
Why's that a surprise?

13:30.330 --> 13:34.380
B-because it looks good on you...

13:39.420 --> 13:40.630
Well, then...

13:41.080 --> 13:43.130
Maybe I'll buy it and wear it out today.

13:45.380 --> 13:46.210
Sorry!

13:58.130 --> 13:59.540
Are you okay for time?

13:59.540 --> 14:01.130
Not like I have plans...

14:02.290 --> 14:04.670
Time sure is flying today...

14:04.920 --> 14:06.630
Sorry about today.

14:07.250 --> 14:12.000
You must be exhausted getting dragged
around places I wanted to go.

14:14.670 --> 14:18.330
Y-Yamada's worried about today?

14:19.960 --> 14:21.170
Oh, right.

14:21.500 --> 14:26.500
I've been so preoccupied with myself that
I didn't do much to put her mind at ease, I guess.

14:28.000 --> 14:29.670
You know, I...

14:31.420 --> 14:34.710
You don't really know much about me, huh?

14:35.420 --> 14:37.710
I'm not a people person.

14:38.000 --> 14:40.330
Not someone afraid of turning down invitations, either.

14:40.880 --> 14:42.960
When I want someone to screw off, I say so.

14:42.960 --> 14:44.710
When something sucks, I say so.

14:44.830 --> 14:46.500
That's just the way I am.

14:47.420 --> 14:48.380
So...

14:49.330 --> 14:51.540
I guess that means...

14:52.500 --> 14:55.580
Today was fun, probably.

14:57.880 --> 14:58.670
I can tell.

15:01.420 --> 15:02.460
I mean...

15:02.670 --> 15:06.130
You never really talk about yourself like this, otherwise.

15:07.330 --> 15:08.170
Oh...

15:09.830 --> 15:11.420
Have you always been that way?

15:11.420 --> 15:12.960
No, I just...

15:14.960 --> 15:16.000
What's this for?

15:16.250 --> 15:19.670
I wore it here this morning, but then got too hot.

15:23.710 --> 15:25.380
I can't even look down anymore...

15:30.880 --> 15:32.330
How beautiful...

15:38.380 --> 15:40.580
I really wanted to come out and see this today.

15:41.790 --> 15:43.250
Never seen anything like it.

15:43.250 --> 15:44.250
No way!

15:48.830 --> 15:54.580
Okay, that's a lie,
but I've never knew the lights could be this nice...

16:00.040 --> 16:02.290
The train bound for Shinagawa and Tokyo will be arriving shortly.

16:02.290 --> 16:03.960
Oh, I'll carry the manga for you.
The train bound for Shinagawa and Tokyo will be arriving shortly.<b></b>

16:03.960 --> 16:04.630
Huh?
Please stand behind the yellow line-<b></b>

16:04.920 --> 16:05.580
What?

16:05.580 --> 16:06.830
Nothing.

16:08.790 --> 16:10.960
The handles are pretty damp.

16:11.670 --> 16:13.380
My hands get clammy.

16:23.960 --> 16:25.080
Yamada...

16:27.460 --> 16:31.830
Wait. I-is that...Yamada's hand?

16:32.040 --> 16:33.500
What if it's not? Is this a trap?!

16:34.500 --> 16:37.580
If I grab it again, I'll be labeled a creep...

16:39.630 --> 16:40.880
Sweaty hands...

17:36.920 --> 17:42.130
We sort of lost sense of when to stop holding hands...

17:45.880 --> 17:47.460
<b>We</b>

17:46.040 --> 17:49.380
And just slowly...

17:51.000 --> 17:52.080
Very slowly...

17:53.130 --> 17:57.080
<b>Walked</b>

18:04.830 --> 18:09.750
I'm worried she might realize how I feel.

18:13.250 --> 18:15.000
This is me, then.

18:15.330 --> 18:16.170
Yeah...

18:16.500 --> 18:17.830
Have a happy New Year-

18:18.630 --> 18:22.790
There's still the 25th, 26th, 27th, 28th...

18:23.250 --> 18:25.040
There's plenty left to go.

18:25.630 --> 18:29.750
So, let's not say that just yet...

18:32.580 --> 18:34.790
See you, then.

18:36.670 --> 18:38.080
Watch where you're going.

18:55.250 --> 18:57.750
Merry Christmas!

18:57.750 --> 18:59.540
Ho, ho, ho!

18:59.540 --> 19:01.080
The whole holy night thing...

19:01.330 --> 19:03.210
Ho, ho, ho!

19:03.830 --> 19:05.460
Doesn't really matter.

19:06.000 --> 19:07.250
What are you doing?

19:07.250 --> 19:08.670
I'm Yamada Santa!

19:08.790 --> 19:10.460
But it almost feels like my feelings might get across...
And that would be...?<b></b>

19:10.460 --> 19:12.790
But it almost feels like my feelings might get across...
Ho, ho, ho!<b></b>

19:14.380 --> 19:15.830
Like she might know I like her.

19:15.580 --> 19:18.960
<b>We Walked Slowly</b>

20:49.000 --> 20:51.920
<b>Kimi Iro Octave</b>

20:52.500 --> 20:55.330
I keep turning things over again in my head...

20:55.830 --> 20:59.830
Thinking about all I should have done.
The things I should have said.

21:00.130 --> 21:02.630
What was even with that whole day, though?

21:04.960 --> 21:06.790
A-are you...

21:07.080 --> 21:09.540
<b>Kimi Iro Octave</b>

21:07.540 --> 21:09.130
Nigorikawa?!

21:09.790 --> 21:11.130
I'm you.

21:11.130 --> 21:14.580
And you're me, Imaginary Kyotaro.

21:14.580 --> 21:17.290
I'm so stuck on this I've developed another personality?

21:17.290 --> 21:18.500
Think about it.

21:19.130 --> 21:20.540
About what happened yesterday.

21:23.960 --> 21:25.540
Not the pervy stuff.

21:27.000 --> 21:29.040
You said something important.

21:30.040 --> 21:31.330
Right there...

21:35.210 --> 21:37.250
Not now...

21:38.130 --> 21:40.290
You feel it, don't you?

21:41.460 --> 21:43.580
Like you have a chance with her.

21:45.130 --> 21:48.000
I mean, 'course I do.

21:48.250 --> 21:51.380
We held hands and all.

21:51.380 --> 21:53.170
That's basically like...

21:53.830 --> 21:58.830
But Yamada's always touchy with her other friends.

21:58.830 --> 22:01.960
Maybe she's just treating me the same.

22:03.540 --> 22:04.580
What do you think?

22:04.750 --> 22:05.420
You might be right...

22:05.420 --> 22:07.000
You're not supposed to agree with me!

22:07.420 --> 22:09.500
Why don't you try manning up and getting in shape?

22:09.750 --> 22:14.250
If she's still hanging all over you after that,
then that means...

22:14.500 --> 22:15.630
Then that means...

22:20.170 --> 22:21.040
Oww!

22:24.460 --> 22:27.170
<b>Anna Yamada</b>

22:24.460 --> 22:27.170
<b>Did you read it?</b>

22:24.460 --> 22:27.170
<b>I am now</b>

22:24.460 --> 22:27.170
<b>Goodnight</b>

22:27.750 --> 22:30.960
All these emotions are Yamada's fault, right?

22:31.330 --> 22:35.500
Why do I always forget that when she's around?

22:31.330 --> 22:36.040
<b>Good-</b>

22:41.170 --> 22:41.630
Everything's fine.

22:41.630 --> 22:42.380
Rgh...
Everything's fine.<b></b>

22:42.380 --> 22:43.380
Everything's fine.

22:43.380 --> 22:44.670
It all comes back to me eventually, though...

22:44.670 --> 22:45.580
It all comes back to me eventually, though...
There, there.<b></b>

22:45.580 --> 22:46.830
It all comes back to me eventually, though...

22:46.830 --> 22:48.250
Nothing to be scared of.
